{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547540/extras/Corn.gif?t=1734354013\" />The game tells the story of Taylor Fox, the journalist. He comes to the Grayswood farm to shoot a photo documentary about the strange phenomena happening around the place. The farmer\u2019s family reports on bright lights in the sky, violent behavior in animals, and other odd events. But once the journalist comes to the farm he is confronted with far more horrifying things.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547540/extras/Aliens_1.gif?t=1734354013\" />They Are Here is a classic, linear, plot-centered first-person horror game. The player will be investigating the area \u23af searching for artefacts, reading notes and documents, examining photos, studying audio and video tapes. The player\u2019s tools include a flashlight, a walkie-talkie, a camera and video equipment to record evidence of the aliens\u2019 activity. There are several locations in the game: a farm, a military base, etc. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547540/extras/Ufo_flash.gif?t=1734354013\" />We have released a Prologue, which is now available in the updated version! The prologue tells us about the first UFO contact, which happened many years before the events of the demo. The hero of the story is private Michael Anderson stationed at the military base near the Grayswood farm, who by quirky chance becomes a witness to terrible, inexplicable events.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1547540?t=1734354013","background_raw":"https://store.akam